# ripgrep-only overrides. Read by rg (and fd) at higher precedence than
# .gitignore; git itself never looks at this file.
#
# The design vault is cloned into this tree as separate repositories and is
# gitignored so a stray `git add -A` cannot publish a private repo into the
# public one. But gitignoring it also hides it from a bare `rg <term>`, which
# silently turns "no design exists" into the wrong answer. Re-include it for
# search only.
!knowledge-base/
!knowledge-history/
